      ],
      "justification": "Maps the structural split and the positive condition for permitting data."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "proceed with permitting the data."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct action match."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "release the data if permitted"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct action match."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9",
        "guard:b1->n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"not permit data\" option is chosen"
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the negative path condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "contact the selling agency if not permitted."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct action match."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "check the worth of the orders."
      ],
      "justification": "The action of checking the worth of orders, along with the convergence of paths preceding it."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_after_12->b2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"not permit data\" option is chosen"
      ],
      "justification": "The model restates the check on the permit data status to route correctly toward the 'cancel' logic (which only applies if the agency was contacted)."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_after_12->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"permit data\" option is selected"
      ],
      "justification": "Routes the permitted data path around the cancel logic."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13",
        "guard:b2->n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the orders are to be released"
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the decision branch and positive condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct action match."
    },
    {
